07523","isbn":"","locale":"cy","number_of_pages":5,"title":"Nodiadau Partneriaeth (byr) (2023)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/64464f1af126830011ca6670/SA104S_notes_2023_Cymraeg.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Use this short version of the SA104 supplementary pages when filing your <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/how-to-complete-your-self-assessment-tax-return-for-last-tax-year\">SA100 Tax Return</a> if you’re only declaring partnership trading income, and interest or alternative finance receipts received after tax was deducted from banks or building societies.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"related-forms-and-guidance\">Related forms and guidance</h2>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/limit-on-income-tax-reliefs-hs204-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Limit on Income Tax reliefs (Self Assessment helpsheet HS204)</a> <br>\nFind out the total amount of certain Income Tax reliefs that can be used to reduce your total taxable income and complete your Self Assessment tax return.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The Self Assessment (partnership) (short) forms have been added for the 2025 to 2026 tax year. The form and notes for the 2021 to 2022 tax year have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-05T23:15:22Z"},{"note":"The form and notes have been added for the 2024 to 2025 tax year. The form and notes for the 2020 to 2021 tax year have been removed.","public_timestamp":"2025-04-05T23:30:09Z"},{"note":"The Self Assessment (partnership) (short) forms have been added for the 2023 to 2024 tax year. ","public_timestamp":"2024-04-05T23:15:17Z"},{"note":"The correct versions of form SA104S and notes for 2023 have been added.","public_timestamp":"2023-04-24T10:22:24Z"},{"note":"The Partnership (short) notes and form have been added for tax year 2022 to 2023.\r\n\r\n","public_timestamp":"2023-04-05T23:15:19Z"},{"note":"The Partnership (short) 